{"id": "q1", "kind": "design", "topic_key": "design.redis-batch-flush", "text": "点赞计数在这个项目里是怎么存储和落库的？为什么这样设计？", "key_points": [{"point": "点赞时用 Redis ZSet 的 incrementScore 累加计数", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 55, "end_line": 55}], "keywords": ["incrementScore", "ZSet"]}, {"point": "CountFlushJob 用 @Scheduled 每 60 秒把 ZSet 里的计数批量刷回数据库", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/job/CountFlushJob.java", "start_line": 22, "end_line": 32}], "keywords": ["CountFlushJob", "Scheduled"]}, {"point": "刷库通过 saveLikeCount 调用 FeedMapper.updateLikeCount", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 68, "end_line": 71}], "keywords": ["saveLikeCount", "updateLikeCount"]}]}
{"id": "q2", "kind": "mechanism", "topic_key": "tx:FeedServiceImpl.saveLikeCount", "text": "saveLikeCount 上的事务注解是怎么配置的？这样配置有什么效果？", "key_points": [{"point": "传播行为是 REQUIRES_NEW，每次调用都新开一个事务", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 68, "end_line": 71}], "keywords": ["REQUIRES_NEW"]}, {"point": "rollbackFor = Exception.class，受检异常也会回滚", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 68, "end_line": 68}], "keywords": ["rollbackFor", "Exception"]}]}
{"id": "q3", "kind": "risk", "topic_key": "risk.self-invoke-async:LikeListener.notifyAuthor", "text": "LikeListener 里的 @Async 能生效吗？为什么？", "key_points": [{"point": "onLike 在同一个类里直接调用 notifyAuthor，是自调用", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/listener/LikeListener.java", "start_line": 13, "end_line": 16}], "keywords": ["onLike", "notifyAuthor"]}, {"point": "自调用不经过 Spring 代理，@Async 不生效，notifyAuthor 仍在监听线程同步执行", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/listener/LikeListener.java", "start_line": 18, "end_line": 21}], "keywords": ["代理", "Async"]}]}
{"id": "q4", "kind": "mechanism", "topic_key": "concurrency:FeedServiceImpl.like", "text": "like 方法怎么保证并发安全？锁是怎么释放的？", "key_points": [{"point": "用 RedissonClient.getLock 获取按 feedId 区分的分布式锁 RLock", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 48, "end_line": 50}], "keywords": ["getLock", "RLock"]}, {"point": "tryLock 最多等 1 秒、持有 5 秒，拿不到就抛异常", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 52, "end_line": 54}], "keywords": ["tryLock"]}, {"point": "finally 里先判断 isHeldByCurrentThread 再 unlock，避免释放别人的锁", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 61, "end_line": 65}], "keywords": ["isHeldByCurrentThread", "unlock"]}]}
{"id": "q5", "kind": "chain", "topic_key": "chain:POST /api/feed/{id}/like", "text": "POST /api/feed/{id}/like 这个接口从入口到数据层经过了哪些步骤？", "key_points": [{"point": "FeedController.like 调用 FeedService.like，实际实现是 FeedServiceImpl.like", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/controller/FeedController.java", "start_line": 32, "end_line": 36}], "keywords": ["FeedController", "FeedServiceImpl"]}, {"point": "FeedServiceImpl.like 加锁后写 Redis ZSet 计数", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 47, "end_line": 58}], "keywords": ["incrementScore"]}, {"point": "随后用 RabbitTemplate.convertAndSend 发消息通知", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/service/impl/FeedServiceImpl.java", "start_line": 56, "end_line": 56}], "keywords": ["convertAndSend", "RabbitTemplate"]}]}
{"id": "q6", "kind": "mechanism", "topic_key": "concurrency:AsyncConfig.feedExecutor", "text": "feedExecutor 线程池的参数是怎么配的？队列满了会怎样？", "key_points": [{"point": "核心线程 4、最大线程 8、队列容量 1000", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/config/AsyncConfig.java", "start_line": 12, "end_line": 15}], "keywords": ["setCorePoolSize", "setMaxPoolSize", "setQueueCapacity"]}, {"point": "没有设置拒绝策略，默认 AbortPolicy，队列满且线程到上限时抛异常", "evidence": [{"path": "src/main/java/com/example/feed/config/AsyncConfig.java", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 18}], "keywords": ["AbortPolicy", "拒绝策略"]}]}
